---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Air Conditioning Repair Canoga Park CA"
  description="Terms of service for airconditioningrepaircanongaparkca.us and related HVAC services."
  canonical="/terms/"
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> <span>/</span> <span>Terms of Service</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p>Last updated: November 2025</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 720px; line-height: 1.7;">
      <p style="margin-bottom: 20px; color: var(--color-muted);">
        By using the website airconditioningrepaircanongaparkca.us or requesting services from Air Conditioning Repair Canoga Park CA, you agree to these terms.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 28px 0 12px;">Website Use</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-muted);">
        Content on this website is provided for general information about our HVAC services. It is not a substitute for professional diagnosis of your specific equipment. Pricing ranges are approximate and final costs depend on on-site evaluation.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 28px 0 12px;">Service Requests</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-muted);">
        Submitting a form or calling does not guarantee appointment availability. Service is subject to technician availability, access to the property, and mutual agreement on scope and pricing before work begins.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 28px 0 12px;">Estimates and Work Authorization</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-muted);">
        We provide estimates based on observed conditions. Additional issues discovered during repair may require further authorization. You are responsible for ensuring safe access to equipment and for any required permits beyond those we agree to handle.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 28px 0 12px;">Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-muted);">
        To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for indirect or consequential damages arising from website use or from services performed, beyond the amount paid for the specific service in question.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 28px 0 12px;">Changes</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-muted);">
        We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the website after changes constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 28px 0 12px;">Contact</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-muted);">
        Questions about these terms may be directed to info@airconditioningrepaircanongaparkca.us.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
